Nanti, jika Anda butuh

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:53.510
skala lebih besar

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:54.370
migrasikan ke Dataverse

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:54.750
atau SQL.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:56.130
Lebih baik menangkap

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.210
data terstruktur hari ini

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:57.930
daripada menunggu

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:58.950
sampai pimpinan menuntut

00:18:58.950 --> 00:18:59.930
sejak 5 tahun besok.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:00.790
Berikut adalah

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:01.450
daftar periksa cepat

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.190
dari skenario terbaik.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:03.010
Pertama,

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.350
pilih penyimpanan persisten

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.290
Dataverse, SQL

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:05.970
atau SharePoint

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:07.010
dengan cadangan tepat.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:07.870
Kedua,

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:08.930
tentukan skema minimal,

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:09.970
ID permintaan,

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:10.690
tahap, tindakan,

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:11.790
ID pemberi persetujuan,

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:12.370
stempel waktu,

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:13.070
tautan korelasi.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:14.730
Selanjutnya,

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:15.530
tulis log pada setiap

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.470
persetujuan atau eskalasi.

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:17.470
Terakhir,

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.250
buat laporan kecil

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.310
di Power BI atau Excel

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.070
agar auditor melihat

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:21.170
kejelasan dalam hitungan detik.

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:22.530
Itudah cara mengamankan

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:23.090
masa depan dan langsung.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:24.030
Tanpa basa-basi,

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:24.830
hanya langkah yang benar-benar

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:25.330
bisa Anda lakukan.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:25.990
Jadi,

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:26.990
jangan pertaruhkan karya Anda

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:27.590
pada file CSV

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.250
yang tersumbung di desktop.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:29.690
Simpan persetujuan

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.330
di tempat yang tanam.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.830
Jaga formatnya tetap terstruktur

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.390
dan bisa di-QF.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:33.510
Buat laporan kecil sekarang

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:34.370
agar Anda tetap berjadikan.
